## What must happen first (for whoever resumes G2X)

1. G2-20 and G2-27 sessions finish their Done checks and flip their §12 rows to `done` with the
   evidence path.
2. Only then: re-read §12, confirm all 25 rows `done`, and run the gate — a script (e.g.
   `Tools/scripts/g2x_gate.py --check`, mirroring `Tools/scripts/g1x_gate.py`) that (a) runs every
   G2 reader's `--check` and records PASS/FAIL, (b) re-runs the P0-2 census
